{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 8000}, "text": " Hi, welcome to the EEVblog, an electronics engineering video blog of interest to anyone involved in electronics design."}, {"offsets": {"from": 8000, "to": 10000}, "text": " I'm your host, Dave Jones."}, {"offsets": {"from": 11000, "to": 15000}, "text": " And I'm here with Bart from Cleverscope. He's the designer of that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 15000, "to": 20000}, "text": " Yeah, I make Cleverscopes and I love your blog, Dave. It's a beautiful blog."}, {"offsets": {"from": 20000, "to": 21000}, "text": " Thank you very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 21000, "to": 23000}, "text": " It tells me a hell of a lot of good stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 23000, "to": 25000}, "text": " Well, we make Cleverscopes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 26000}, "text": " Tell us about the Cleverscope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 26000, "to": 28000}, "text": " I can take one here and pull it out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 28000, "to": 36000}, "text": " And it's a little toy. It's a PC scope, so it's going against the Pico scope and all those other little scopes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 36000, "to": 38000}, "text": " This is what it looks like."}, {"offsets": {"from": 38000, "to": 44000}, "text": " It's a pretty average sort of plastic case, but hell, it works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 44000, "to": 47000}, "text": " If you open it, you can see inside."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47000, "to": 50000}, "text": " We have hardware. We have a teardown. Here we go. Here's inside."}, {"offsets": {"from": 50000, "to": 55000}, "text": " Teardown at Dave's blog, live at electronics."}, {"offsets": {"from": 55000, "to": 58000}, "text": " You betcha. And that's inside the Cleverscope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 58000, "to": 61000}, "text": " I assume there would have been several generations?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 62000}, "text": " There have been a few generations."}, {"offsets": {"from": 62000, "to": 63000}, "text": " Cleverscope?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 63000, "to": 65000}, "text": " Yep, there have been. And this is the current one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 70000}, "text": " Except that one's probably a bit bodgy because it's got development stuff inside it, I suspect."}, {"offsets": {"from": 70000, "to": 71000}, "text": " Right, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 71000, "to": 73000}, "text": " No, it's not too bad."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 75000}, "text": " This is the Ethernet version."}, {"offsets": {"from": 75000, "to": 77000}, "text": " So you can see there's the Ethernet board."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 81000}, "text": " Hang on, let's put it down on the table over here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 81000, "to": 85000}, "text": " There we go. And tell us about the hardware."}, {"offsets": {"from": 85000, "to": 86000}, "text": " I'll zoom in on that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 86000, "to": 87000}, "text": " We can do that, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 87000, "to": 89000}, "text": " So this is the digitizer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 89000, "to": 92000}, "text": " And we do them in 10, 12, and 14 bits."}, {"offsets": {"from": 92000, "to": 94000}, "text": " So this is a 14-bit digitizer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 94000, "to": 97000}, "text": " This is all the analog stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 102000}, "text": " And over here we have DC offset, which is so that we can look at just a small chunk of range,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 102000, "to": 106000}, "text": " like 2.1 to 2.2 volts, and digitize across just that chunk."}, {"offsets": {"from": 106000, "to": 107000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 107000, "to": 109000}, "text": " Over here we have our mixed signal input, the eight digital ins."}, {"offsets": {"from": 109000, "to": 110000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 110000, "to": 111000}, "text": " Not too many PCs got to do that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 111000, "to": 112000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 112000, "to": 115000}, "text": " And over here is an Altera Cyclone."}, {"offsets": {"from": 115000, "to": 116000}, "text": " Magnificent device."}, {"offsets": {"from": 116000, "to": 117000}, "text": " That's where all the magic's running."}, {"offsets": {"from": 117000, "to": 119000}, "text": " It's all the magic, and we can change it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 120000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 120000, "to": 123000}, "text": " And people can go and upgrade their hardware in the field later on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 123000, "to": 124000}, "text": " Fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 124000, "to": 125000}, "text": " Memory."}, {"offsets": {"from": 125000, "to": 126000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 126000, "to": 127000}, "text": " SD RAM."}, {"offsets": {"from": 127000, "to": 128000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 128000, "to": 129000}, "text": " It's got a couple of, what is it, eight?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 129000, "to": 130000}, "text": " It's got eight megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 130000, "to": 131000}, "text": " Eight meg of sample memory."}, {"offsets": {"from": 131000, "to": 133000}, "text": " But it's not high sample rate, this one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 133000, "to": 134000}, "text": " It's only 100 meg samples."}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 135000}, "text": " 100 meg samples."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135000, "to": 140000}, "text": " So it's pretty slow, but when you've got a 14-bit converter, that's the magic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 140000, "to": 143000}, "text": " Plus, you've got a trigger that can capture almost anything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 144000}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144000, "to": 145000}, "text": " I reckon, anyway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 145000, "to": 146000}, "text": " Wow, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 146000, "to": 147000}, "text": " Not that you're biased or anything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 148000}, "text": " No, no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 148000, "to": 149000}, "text": " That's right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 149000, "to": 150000}, "text": " All right, but you've got to talk up your own product."}, {"offsets": {"from": 150000, "to": 151000}, "text": " Ethernet interface."}, {"offsets": {"from": 151000, "to": 152000}, "text": " Magnificent device."}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 153000}, "text": " That's the WizNet chip."}, {"offsets": {"from": 153000, "to": 154000}, "text": " I don't know if you've come across those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 154000, "to": 155000}, "text": " Oh, you've heard of it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 156000}, "text": " Hardware, hardware Ethernet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 156000, "to": 157000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 157000, "to": 161000}, "text": " And then here's the SIGGEN, which is a little, using a little analog devices DDS chip."}, {"offsets": {"from": 161000, "to": 162000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 162000, "to": 163000}, "text": " Just shoots us down to the ground."}, {"offsets": {"from": 163000, "to": 165000}, "text": " As you can see, there's a bit of power supply."}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 166000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 167000}, "text": " That's Bob's uncle."}, {"offsets": {"from": 167000, "to": 169000}, "text": " Aluminium case to stop the stuff, bad stuff getting in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 169000, "to": 170000}, "text": " Shielded?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 170000, "to": 171000}, "text": " We have it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 172000}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 172000, "to": 173000}, "text": " Thank you for the teardown."}, {"offsets": {"from": 173000, "to": 175000}, "text": " The interface is LabVIEW."}, {"offsets": {"from": 175000, "to": 176000}, "text": " It's LabVIEW."}, {"offsets": {"from": 176000, "to": 177000}, "text": " It's all built in LabVIEW."}, {"offsets": {"from": 177000, "to": 179000}, "text": " You can see the LabVIEW he sort of controls."}, {"offsets": {"from": 179000, "to": 180000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 180000, "to": 183000}, "text": " But, you know, we have lots of windows here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 183000, "to": 186000}, "text": " One of these, this one over here, is actually not one of ours."}, {"offsets": {"from": 186000, "to": 187000}, "text": " It belongs to MATLAB."}, {"offsets": {"from": 187000, "to": 188000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 192000}, "text": " That's because we were piping through stuff to MATLAB until I pulled the kinescope off"}, {"offsets": {"from": 192000, "to": 194000}, "text": " the rack and stopped it from working."}, {"offsets": {"from": 194000, "to": 196000}, "text": " We had mixed signal, as I say."}, {"offsets": {"from": 196000, "to": 197000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 197000, "to": 199000}, "text": " And we can decode protocols."}, {"offsets": {"from": 199000, "to": 200000}, "text": " Well, we can."}, {"offsets": {"from": 200000, "to": 201000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 202000}, "text": " Not today, we can't."}, {"offsets": {"from": 202000, "to": 203000}, "text": " It's waiting for something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 203000, "to": 204000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 204000, "to": 205000}, "text": " That's all right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 205000, "to": 206000}, "text": " I'm sure it does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 206000, "to": 207000}, "text": " Hang a sec."}, {"offsets": {"from": 207000, "to": 208000}, "text": " Hang a sec."}, {"offsets": {"from": 211000, "to": 212000}, "text": " Why is it happening?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 212000, "to": 213000}, "text": " Anyway, I buggered it up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 213000, "to": 214000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 214000, "to": 219000}, "text": " So, yeah, we've got this graph here, this waveform display, which is mixed signal and it can"}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 221000}, "text": " decode protocols in real time, usually."}, {"offsets": {"from": 221000, "to": 222000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 222000, "to": 225000}, "text": " And we have a maths graph, which you can scan the maths equation to."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225000, "to": 226000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 226000, "to": 227000}, "text": " It's very complicated."}, {"offsets": {"from": 227000, "to": 229000}, "text": " Does that do serial decoding in the hardware?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 229000, "to": 230000}, "text": " Yes, it does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230000, "to": 231000}, "text": " It does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 231000, "to": 232000}, "text": " It does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 232000, "to": 233000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 233000, "to": 234000}, "text": " In the FPGA."}, {"offsets": {"from": 234000, "to": 235000}, "text": " In the FPGA."}, {"offsets": {"from": 235000, "to": 236000}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 236000, "to": 237000}, "text": " So that means you can do triggering and stuff like that, which is what you want."}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 238000}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 238000, "to": 239000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 239000, "to": 240000}, "text": " You have some signal information."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240000, "to": 241000}, "text": " We can do spectra."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241000, "to": 242000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 242000, "to": 243000}, "text": " And lots of other things."}, {"offsets": {"from": 243000, "to": 244000}, "text": " Lots of other stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 244000, "to": 245000}, "text": " So the cleviscope is pretty clever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 245000, "to": 246000}, "text": " Moderately."}, {"offsets": {"from": 246000, "to": 247000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 247000, "to": 248000}, "text": " I think I love this stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 248000, "to": 249000}, "text": " Tell us about the history."}, {"offsets": {"from": 249000, "to": 250000}, "text": " Okay, the history."}, {"offsets": {"from": 250000, "to": 251000}, "text": " I'm an engineer."}, {"offsets": {"from": 251000, "to": 252000}, "text": " Engineers love scopes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 252000, "to": 253000}, "text": " Crows."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 254000}, "text": " I think you call them crows, don't they?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 254000, "to": 255000}, "text": " Crow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 255000, "to": 256000}, "text": " Cathode ray."}, {"offsets": {"from": 256000, "to": 257000}, "text": " That's right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 258000}, "text": " We call them that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 258000, "to": 262000}, "text": " Well, you see, the problem is that I wanted to make a crow like almost anyone else out"}, {"offsets": {"from": 262000, "to": 266799}, "text": " there who wants to make a crow, and I noticed that the cell phone business that generated"}, {"offsets": {"from": 266799, "to": 273600}, "text": " all these really fast analog-to-digital converters and FPGAs, those two together, magic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 273600, "to": 274600}, "text": " You've got a scope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 274600, "to": 276200}, "text": " That's what you have to do, don't you?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 276200, "to": 277399}, "text": " Well, what else was I going to do?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 277399, "to": 278399}, "text": " I made a scope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279399, "to": 284399}, "text": " I designed my own scope back in 1993, got it published in Electronics Australia."}, {"offsets": {"from": 284399, "to": 286399}, "text": " It was extremely popular."}, {"offsets": {"from": 286399, "to": 287399}, "text": " Pretty good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 287399, "to": 288399}, "text": " Digital storage scope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 288399, "to": 291399}, "text": " You know, because back then you could design your own scope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 291399, "to": 292399}, "text": " It was worthwhile."}, {"offsets": {"from": 292399, "to": 293399}, "text": " You could, yeah, you could."}, {"offsets": {"from": 293399, "to": 295399}, "text": " Before the market was flooded with all the Chinese."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295399, "to": 297399}, "text": " Yeah, well, they've come along."}, {"offsets": {"from": 297399, "to": 298399}, "text": " That's right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 298399, "to": 300399}, "text": " So you started a business?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 300399, "to": 301399}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 301399, "to": 302399}, "text": " Just from home?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 302399, "to": 303399}, "text": " Was it a side business at the time?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 303399, "to": 304399}, "text": " Yeah, it was a side business, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 304399, "to": 305399}, "text": " A side business?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 305399, "to": 306399}, "text": " You had a real day job?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 306399, "to": 309399}, "text": " I had a real day job, which was quite tough, and after a while I decided I've done enough"}, {"offsets": {"from": 309399, "to": 310399}, "text": " in that now, you know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 310399, "to": 313399}, "text": " Ten years, whatever it was, I'm going to do a new thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 313399, "to": 315399}, "text": " So this came along on the side."}, {"offsets": {"from": 315399, "to": 319399}, "text": " So how long did it take from when you started it to do a side business?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 319399, "to": 320399}, "text": " How long did it take?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 320399, "to": 321399}, "text": " About a year."}, {"offsets": {"from": 321399, "to": 322399}, "text": " About a year."}, {"offsets": {"from": 322399, "to": 323399}, "text": " Then you went full-time?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 323399, "to": 326399}, "text": " Then we went full-time and got a few other guys, and now we're selling scopes all over"}, {"offsets": {"from": 326399, "to": 327399}, "text": " the world."}, {"offsets": {"from": 327399, "to": 329399}, "text": " How many scopes have you sold, do you know?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 329399, "to": 330399}, "text": " About 8,000."}, {"offsets": {"from": 330399, "to": 331399}, "text": " About 8,000?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 331399, "to": 332399}, "text": " Yeah, something like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 332399, "to": 333399}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 333399, "to": 334399}, "text": " Out of New Zealand?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 334399, "to": 335399}, "text": " Out of New Zealand."}, {"offsets": {"from": 336399, "to": 337399}, "text": " New Zealand."}, {"offsets": {"from": 337399, "to": 338399}, "text": " Can you say six?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 338399, "to": 339399}, "text": " Six."}, {"offsets": {"from": 339399, "to": 340399}, "text": " Six."}, {"offsets": {"from": 344399, "to": 347399}, "text": " So there's been several..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 347399, "to": 349399}, "text": " There's been several generations, that's right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 349399, "to": 354399}, "text": " We had an earlier one, which was USB-1 based, and had an older FPGA."}, {"offsets": {"from": 354399, "to": 357399}, "text": " It was a bit slow and we couldn't fit enough stuff into it, so of course we had to make"}, {"offsets": {"from": 357399, "to": 358399}, "text": " a new one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 358399, "to": 359399}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 359399, "to": 363399}, "text": " And yeah, so we've got a new one coming after this, but it's not released yet, but it might"}, {"offsets": {"from": 363399, "to": 364399}, "text": " get there eventually."}, {"offsets": {"from": 364399, "to": 365399}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365399, "to": 366399}, "text": " So you've still only got the one..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 366399, "to": 368399}, "text": " Have you got one model, or have you got several models?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 368399, "to": 370399}, "text": " We really only have one model."}, {"offsets": {"from": 370399, "to": 372399}, "text": " You know, we make variations on it, but there's one model."}, {"offsets": {"from": 372399, "to": 373399}, "text": " Choice is too hard."}, {"offsets": {"from": 373399, "to": 374399}, "text": " It is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 374399, "to": 375399}, "text": " It's much too hard, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 375399, "to": 376399}, "text": " There's just one, that's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 376399, "to": 377399}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 377399, "to": 379399}, "text": " But the next one, that will have lots of variation."}, {"offsets": {"from": 379399, "to": 380399}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 380399, "to": 381399}, "text": " In detail?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 381399, "to": 382399}, "text": " Yeah, well, digitally it's isolated channels."}, {"offsets": {"from": 382399, "to": 383399}, "text": " Isolated, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 383399, "to": 385399}, "text": " I don't know if that interests you at all."}, {"offsets": {"from": 385399, "to": 388399}, "text": " Yes, isolation is big between individual channels."}, {"offsets": {"from": 388399, "to": 389399}, "text": " Between individual channels."}, {"offsets": {"from": 389399, "to": 390399}, "text": " As well as the PC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 390399, "to": 391399}, "text": " Absolutely."}, {"offsets": {"from": 391399, "to": 394399}, "text": " So once you've got the individual channels, you don't need the..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 394399, "to": 396399}, "text": " Or is the USB isolated as well?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 396399, "to": 398399}, "text": " On here, the USB is not isolated."}, {"offsets": {"from": 398399, "to": 399399}, "text": " It's not isolated."}, {"offsets": {"from": 399399, "to": 402399}, "text": " And on the next one, the USB is also not isolated, because it's USB 3."}, {"offsets": {"from": 402399, "to": 403399}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403399, "to": 406399}, "text": " And USB 3 is even harder to isolate than USB 2."}, {"offsets": {"from": 406399, "to": 409399}, "text": " Are you running that at the full USB 3 throughput?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 409399, "to": 410399}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 410399, "to": 411399}, "text": " What's the speed of it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 411399, "to": 412399}, "text": " Five gigabits per second."}, {"offsets": {"from": 412399, "to": 413399}, "text": " Five gigabits per second."}, {"offsets": {"from": 413399, "to": 414399}, "text": " It's going pretty fast."}, {"offsets": {"from": 414399, "to": 415399}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 415399, "to": 416399}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 416399, "to": 417399}, "text": " So you've got that prototype?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 417399, "to": 418399}, "text": " Yeah, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 418399, "to": 419399}, "text": " We're getting, we're coming along."}, {"offsets": {"from": 419399, "to": 420399}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 420399, "to": 427399}, "text": " So, but the isolation is aimed at people who want to make motor control drives and UPSs"}, {"offsets": {"from": 427399, "to": 430399}, "text": " and power supplies and all that sort of stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 430399, "to": 431399}, "text": " How many channels is that going to be?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 431399, "to": 432399}, "text": " Four."}, {"offsets": {"from": 432399, "to": 433399}, "text": " Four, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 433399, "to": 434399}, "text": " I was going to say, when you go isolated..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 434399, "to": 435399}, "text": " Yeah, you need four."}, {"offsets": {"from": 435399, "to": 436399}, "text": " That's right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 436399, "to": 440399}, "text": " People typically want to monitor quite a few items."}, {"offsets": {"from": 440399, "to": 441399}, "text": " So that's awesome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 441399, "to": 442399}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 442399, "to": 444399}, "text": " Is that going to be reasonably..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 444399, "to": 445399}, "text": " Priced?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 445399, "to": 446399}, "text": " Does it up the price?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 446399, "to": 452399}, "text": " It does up the price a lot because you've then got to somehow isolate all that data"}, {"offsets": {"from": 452399, "to": 455399}, "text": " and have a clock that gets its way around the place."}, {"offsets": {"from": 455399, "to": 456399}, "text": " Yeah, it ups the price."}, {"offsets": {"from": 456399, "to": 457399}, "text": " What's the sample?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 457399, "to": 458399}, "text": " Sample rate of that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 458399, "to": 462399}, "text": " That will be, we're doing it in two versions."}, {"offsets": {"from": 462399, "to": 465399}, "text": " The lower version is 250 mega samples."}, {"offsets": {"from": 465399, "to": 466399}, "text": " Still pretty slow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 466399, "to": 467399}, "text": " 16 bits though."}, {"offsets": {"from": 467399, "to": 468399}, "text": " 16 bit converter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 468399, "to": 469399}, "text": " 16 bits."}, {"offsets": {"from": 469399, "to": 470399}, "text": " Fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 470399, "to": 471399}, "text": " Keep going."}, {"offsets": {"from": 471399, "to": 473399}, "text": " And 25 kV per microsecond common mode noise."}, {"offsets": {"from": 473399, "to": 474399}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 474399, "to": 475399}, "text": " Which is right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 475399, "to": 479399}, "text": " And the other one is five gigabits per second based on that E2V converter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 479399, "to": 480399}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 480399, "to": 481399}, "text": " Five."}, {"offsets": {"from": 481399, "to": 482399}, "text": " Excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 482399, "to": 487399}, "text": " But you've got the high that you're using the USB 3 to get the data throughput you need."}, {"offsets": {"from": 487399, 