ant to go really fast, you will need one of them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 537400, "to": 538400}, "text": " You will."}, {"offsets": {"from": 538400, "to": 539400}, "text": " That's right, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 539400, "to": 543400}, "text": " I mean the one in my little laptop here, I think it can only handle about 40 megabytes"}, {"offsets": {"from": 543400, "to": 544400}, "text": " per second."}, {"offsets": {"from": 544400, "to": 545400}, "text": " 40 megabytes per second."}, {"offsets": {"from": 545400, "to": 547400}, "text": " It's not that much really."}, {"offsets": {"from": 547400, "to": 548400}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 548400, "to": 549400}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 549400, "to": 550400}, "text": " Oh, excellent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 550400, "to": 551400}, "text": " So we've got some interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 551400, "to": 552400}, "text": " We have got lots of interesting stuff coming."}, {"offsets": {"from": 552400, "to": 554400}, "text": " And how many people do you employ now?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 554400, "to": 555400}, "text": " It's not large."}, {"offsets": {"from": 555400, "to": 556400}, "text": " Right, no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 556400, "to": 557400}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 557400, "to": 558400}, "text": " I didn't mention that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 558400, "to": 559400}, "text": " It's sort of a six man company."}, {"offsets": {"from": 559400, "to": 560400}, "text": " Oh, that's decent size."}, {"offsets": {"from": 560400, "to": 561400}, "text": " Yeah, it's pretty good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 561400, "to": 562400}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 562400, "to": 563400}, "text": " Doing well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 563400, "to": 564400}, "text": " And where's it made?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 564400, "to": 565400}, "text": " Oh, it's made in Auckland."}, {"offsets": {"from": 565400, "to": 566400}, "text": " It's made in Auckland."}, {"offsets": {"from": 566400